Didn't your mother ever tell you not to play with your food?

53
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:16,440
What do you want?

54
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:19,900
I'm here to announce that King Mufasa's on his way,

55
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:23,570
so you'd better have a good excuse for missing this morning's ceremony

56
00:05:23,860 --> 00:05:25,280
Oh, look, Zazu

57
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,610
You've made me lose my lunch

58
00:05:26,700 --> 00:05:29,620
You'll lose more than that when the king gets through with you

59
00:05:29,700 --> 00:05:32,370
He's as mad as a hippo with a hernia

60
00:05:32,870 --> 00:05:35,910
I quiver with fear!

61
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,540
Now, Scar, don't look at me that way

62
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:39,920
Help!

63
00:05:40,250 --> 00:05:41,340
Scar?

64
00:05:42,460 --> 00:05:43,550
Drop him

65
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:46,880
Impeccable timing, Your Majesty

66
00:05:49,930 --> 00:05:54,020
Why, if it isn't my big brother descending from on high

67
00:05:54,100 --> 00:05:56,140
to mingle with the commoners

68
00:05:56,270 --> 00:05:59,350
Sarabi and I didn't see you at the presentation of Simba

69
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:01,560
That was today?

70
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:03,980
I feel simply awful !

71
00:06:05,940 --> 00:06:07,950
Must've slipped my mind

72
00:06:08,070 --> 00:06:11,240
Yes, well, as slippery as your mind is,

73
00:06:11,370 --> 00:06:14,240
as the king's brother, you should've been first in line!

74
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:19,290
Well, I was first in line, until the little hairball was born

75
00:06:19,370 --> 00:06:24,380
That hairball is my son and your future king

76
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:27,130
I shall practise my curtsy!

77
00:06:27,510 --> 00:06:29,800
Don't turn your back on me, Scar

78
00:06:29,890 --> 00:06:31,220
Oh, no, Mufasa

79
00:06:31,300 --> 00:06:34,140
Perhaps you shouldn't turn your back on me

80
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:37,140
Is that a challenge?

81
00:06:37,350 --> 00:06:38,730
Temper, temper

82
00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:41,980
I wouldn't dream of challenging you

83
00:06:42,060 --> 00:06:43,980
Pity Why not?

84
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:47,400
Well, as far as brains go, I got the lion's share

85
00:06:47,490 --> 00:06:50,820
But when it comes to brute strength,

86
00:06:50,910 --> 00:06:55,080
I'm afraid I'm at the shallow end of the gene pool

87
00:06:58,250 --> 00:07:00,460
There's one in every family, sire

88
00:07:00,790 --> 00:07:02,080
Two in mine, actually,

89
00:07:02,580 --> 00:07:05,290
and they always manage to ruin special occasions

90
00:07:05,670 --> 00:07:07,340
What am I going to do with him?

91
00:07:07,420 --> 00:07:09,170
He'd make a very handsome throw rug

92
00:07:09,260 --> 00:07:10,340
Zazu !

93
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:12,840
And just think, whenever he gets dirty,

94
00:07:12,930 --> 00:07:15,010
you could take him out and beat him

95
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,230
Simba

96
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:17,070
Dad ! Dad !

97
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:19,580
Come on, dad, we gotta go! Wake up!

98
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:22,080
Sorry

99
00:08:23,290 --> 00:08:25,370
Dad ! Dad !

100
00:08:25,460 --> 00:08:28,340
Your son is awake

101
00:08:28,420 --> 00:08:31,460
Before sunrise, he's your son

102
00:08:31,590 --> 00:08:33,670
Dad ! Come on, Dad

103
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:40,100
You promised

104
00:08:40,930 --> 00:08:42,810
Okay, Okay I'm up, I'm up

105
00:08:42,930 --> 00:08:44,020
Yeah !

106
00:09:00,290 --> 00:09:01,370
Look, Simba

107
00:09:01,950 --> 00:09:05,540
Everything the light touches is our kingdom

108
00:09:05,620 --> 00:09:07,330
Wow

109
00:09:07,460 --> 00:09:12,340
A king's time as ruler rises and falls like the sun

110
00:09:12,460 --> 00:09:16,380
One day, Simba, the sun will set on my time here

111
00:09:16,470 --> 00:09:19,890
and will rise with you as the new king

112
00:09:19,970 --> 00:09:22,680
And this'll all be mine? Everything

113
00:09:22,770 --> 00:09:25,640
Everything the light touches

114
00:09:26,350 --> 00:09:27,900
What about that shadowy place?

115
00:09:28,150 --> 00:09:30,110
That's beyond our borders

116
00:09:30,190 --> 00:09:31,570
You must never go there, Simba

117
00:09:31,650 --> 00:09:33,730
But I thought a king can do whatever he wants

118
00:09:33,820 --> 00:09:37,150
Oh, there's more to being king than getting your way all the time

119
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:39,570
There's more? Simba

120
00:09:43,330 --> 00:09:47,750
Everything you see exists together in a delicate balance

121
00:09:47,830 --> 00:09:50,750
As king, you need to understand that balance

122
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,590
and respect all the creatures,

123
00:09:52,670 --> 00:09:55,510
from the crawling ant to the leaping antelope

124
00:09:55,590 --> 00:09:57,420
But, Dad, don't we eat the antelope?

125
00:09:57,510 --> 00:10:00,090
Yes, Simba, but let me explain

126
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:03,140
When we die, our bodies become the grass,

127
00:10:03,430 --> 00:10:05,890
and the antelope eat the grass

128
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:11,230
And so we are all connected in the great circle of life

129
00:10:11,310 --> 00:10:13,570
Good morning, sire! Good morning, Zazu

130
00:10:13,650 --> 00:10:15,570
Checking in with the morning report

131
00:10:15,650 --> 00:10:16,740
Fire away

132
00:10:16,820 --> 00:10:18,400
Well ! The buzz from the bees

133
00:10:18,490 --> 00:10:20,410
is that the leopards are in a bit of a spot

134
00:10:20,490 --> 00:10:21,570
Really?

135
00:10:22,490 --> 00:10:23,990
What are you doing, son?

136
00:10:24,620 --> 00:10:25,660
Pouncing

137
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:28,120
Let an old pro show you how it's done

138
00:10:28,290 --> 00:10:31,080
I told the elephants to forget it, but they can't

139
00:10:31,170 --> 00:10:33,000
Zazu, would you turn around? Yes, sire

140
00:10:33,130 --> 00:10:34,170
The cheetahs are hard up, but

141
00:10:34,300 --> 00:10:35,920
Stay low to the ground

142
00:10:36,010 --> 00:10:37,260
Cheetahs never prosper

143
00:10:37,340 --> 00:10:39,430
Yeah, okay Stay low to the ground, right? Yeah

144
00:10:39,510 --> 00:10:40,680
What going on? A pouncing lesson

145
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:43,010
Very good Pouncing

146
00:10:43,100 --> 00:10:46,520
Pouncing? No, sire, you can't be serious

147
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,270
This is so humiliating

148
00:10:49,350 --> 00:10:50,940
Try not to make a sound

149
00:10:51,020 --> 00:10:53,310
What are you telling him, Mufasa?

150
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:56,650
Mufasa? Simba?

151
00:11:00,530 --> 00:11:01,700
That's very good

152
00:11:02,370 --> 00:11:03,620
Zazu ! Yes!

153
00:11:03,700 --> 00:11:06,370
News from the underground Now, this time

154
00:11:06,450 --> 00:11:09,710
Sire! Hyenas in the Pride Lands!

155
00:11:09,830 --> 00:11:11,290
Zazu, take Simba home

156
00:11:11,370 --> 00:11:12,540
Dad, can't I come?

157
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:13,710
No, son

158
00:11:15,210 --> 00:11:16,960
I never get to go anywhere

159
00:11:17,050 --> 00:11:21,130
Young master, one day, you will be king

160
00:11:21,220 --> 00:11:25,140
Then you can chase those slobbering, mangy, stupid poachers

161
00:11:25,220 --> 00:11:27,220
from dawn until dusk

162
00:11:34,310 --> 00:11:36,650
Hey, Uncle Scar! Guess what?

163
00:11:36,730 --> 00:11:39,820
I despise guessing games

164
00:11:39,900 --> 00:11:41,990
I'm gonna be King of Pride Rock

165
00:11:42,070 --> 00:11:44,320
Oh, goody!

166
00:11:44,410 --> 00:11:46,160
My dad just showed me the whole kingdom,

167
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:49,240
and I'm gonna rule it all !

168
00:11:49,370 --> 00:11:52,830
Yes Well, forgive me for not leaping for joy

169
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:55,250
Bad back, you know

170
00:11:56,250 --> 00:11:57,420
Hey, Uncle Scar

171
00:11:57,500 --> 00:11:59,840
When I'm king, what'll that make you?

172
00:11:59,920 --> 00:12:02,170
A monkey's uncle

173
00:12:02,260 --> 00:12:06,100
You're so weird You have no idea

174
00:12:06,180 --> 00:12:09,350
So, your father showed you the whole kingdom, did he?

175
00:12:09,430 --> 00:12:10,520
Everything

176
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:14,190
He didn't show you what's beyond that rise at the northern border?

177
00:12:14,560 --> 00:12:17,690
Well, no He said I can't go there

178
00:12:17,770 --> 00:12:19,780
And he's absolutely right

179
00:12:19,900 --> 00:12:21,190
It's far too dangerous

180
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:23,700
Only the bravest lions go there

181
00:12:23,780 --> 00:12:26,450
Well, I'm brave What's out there?

182
00:12:26,570 --> 00:12:28,950
I'm sorry, Simba, I just can't tell you

183
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,120
Why not?

184
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:34,620
I'm only looking out for the wellbeing of my favourite nephew

185
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:37,540
Yeah, right! I'm your only nephew

186
00:12:37,630 --> 00:12:40,130
All the more reason for me to be protective

187
00:12:40,420 --> 00:12:44,470
An elephant graveyard is no place for a young prince Oops!

188
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:47,140
An elephant what? Whoa!

189
00:12:47,300 --> 00:12:50,390
Oh, dear, I've said too much

190
00:12:50,470 --> 00:12:53,310
Well, I suppose you'd have found out sooner or later,

191
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:56,400
you being so clever and all

192
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:58,150
Just do me one favour

193
00:12:58,270 --> 00:13:02,820
Promise me you'll never visit that dreadful place

194
00:13:02,940 --> 00:13:04,320
No problem

195
00:13:04,450 --> 00:13:06,070
There's a good lad

196
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:08,910
You run along now and have fun

197
00:13:08,990 --> 00:13:10,490
And remember,

198
00:13:10,580 --> 00:13:13,080
it's our little secret

199
00:13:20,500 --> 00:13:22,170
Hey, Nala Hi, Simba

200
00:13:22,300 --> 00:13:24,420
Come on I just heard about this great place

201
00:13:24,510 --> 00:13:27,010
Simba! I'm kind of in the middle of a bath

202
00:13:27,140 --> 00:13:29,180
And it's time for yours

203
00:13:30,510 --> 00:13:32,260
Mom !

204
00:13:32,350 --> 00:13:35,270
Mom, you're messing up my mane!

205
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:39,100
Okay, okay, I'm clean Can we go now?

206
00:13:39,190 --> 00:13:40,520
So, where are we going?

207
00:13:40,610 --> 00:13:42,110
It better not be anyplace dumb

208
00:13:42,190 --> 00:13:44,030
No, it's really cool

209
00:13:44,150 --> 00:13:46,700
So, where is this really cool place?

210
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:50,870
Around the water hole The water hole?

211
00:13:50,990 --> 00:13:52,780
What's so great about the water hole?

212
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:55,040
I'll show you when we get there

213
00:13:56,370 --> 00:13:58,210
Mom, can I go with Simba?

214
00:13:59,040 --> 00:14:00,540
What do you think, Sarabi?

215
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:01,710
Well

216
00:14:01,880 --> 00:14:03,130
Please? Please?

217
00:14:03,210 --> 00:14:04,380
It's all right with me

218
00:14:04,460 --> 00:14:05,550
Yeah ! All right!

219
00:14:05,630 --> 00:14:07,550
As long as Zazu goes with you

220
00:14:07,630 --> 00:14:09,220
No, not Zazu

221
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:10,800
Step lively

222
00:14:10,890 --> 00:14:14,890
The sooner we get to the water hole, the sooner we can leave

223
00:14:14,970 --> 00:14:16,850
So, where are we really going?

224
00:14:16,980 --> 00:14:18,350
An elephant graveyard

225
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:19,560
Wow!

226
00:14:19,980 --> 00:14:20,980
Zazu

227
00:14:21,060 --> 00:14:23,820
Right So, how are we gonna ditch the dodo?

228
00:14:24,650 --> 00:14:26,740
Just look at you two

229
00:14:26,820 --> 00:14:29,910
Little seeds of romance blossoming in the savanna

230
00:14:30,030 --> 00:14:32,240
Your parents will be thrilled,

231
00:14:32,370 --> 00:14:34,700
what with your being betrothed and all

232
00:14:34,830 --> 00:14:35,910
Bewhat?

233
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,660
Betrothed Intended

234
00:14:37,750 --> 00:14:39,580
Affianced

235
00:14:39,710 --> 00:14:40,750
Meaning

236
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,840
One day, you two are going to be married

237
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,000
Yuck!

238
00:14:45,090 --> 00:14:47,210
I can't marry her She's my friend

239
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:49,510
Yeah, it'd be so weird

240
00:14:49,590 --> 00:14:51,550
Sorry to bust your bubble,

241
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:54,220
but you two turtle doves have no choice

242
00:14:54,310 --> 00:14:56,770
It's a tradition going back generations

243
00:14:56,890 --> 00:14:59,390
When I'm king, that'll be the first thing to go

244
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:02,310
Not so long as I'm around Well, in that case, you're fired

245
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:04,820
Nice try, but only the king can do that

246
00:15:04,940 --> 00:15:06,480
Well, he's the future king

247
00:15:06,610 --> 00:15:08,940
Yeah, so you have to do what I tell you

248
00:15:09,110 --> 00:15:10,490
Not yet, I don't

249
00:15:10,610 --> 00:15:12,030
And with an attitude like that,

250
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:15,910
I'm afraid you're shaping up to be a pretty pathetic king, indeed

251
00:15:15,990 --> 00:15:17,620
Not the way I see it

252
00:15:18,410 --> 00:15:20,750
l'm gonna be a mighty king

253
00:15:20,830 --> 00:15:22,920
So enemies beware

254
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,590
Well, l've never seen a king of beasts

255
00:15:25,670 --> 00:15:27,840
With quite so little hair

256
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:30,550
l'm gonna be the main event

257
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:32,680
Like no king was before

258
00:15:33,010 --> 00:15:35,390
l'm brushin' up on lookin' down

259
00:15:35,470 --> 00:15:37,600
l'm workin' on my roar

260
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:41,310
Thus far, a rather uninspiring thing

261
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:46,270
Oh, I just can't wait to be king

262
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:49,530
You've rather a long way to go, young master, if you think

263
00:15:49,650 --> 00:15:51,950
No one sayin', "Do this" Now, when l said that

264
00:15:52,030 --> 00:15:54,450
No one saying, "Be there" What I meant was

265
00:15:54,530 --> 00:15:56,870
No one sayin', "Stop that" You don't realise

266
00:15:56,990 --> 00:15:59,790
No one sayin', "See here" Now, see here!

267
00:15:59,870 --> 00:16:03,210
Free to run around all day

268
00:16:03,330 --> 00:16:04,880
Well, that's definitely out

269
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:09,000
Free to do it all my way

270
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:14,300
l think it's time that you and l

271
00:16:14,390 --> 00:16:16,470
Arranged a hearttoheart

272
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:18,310
Kings don't need advice

273
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:20,970
From little hornbills for a start

274
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:24,520
If this is where the monarchy is headed

275
00:16:24,650 --> 00:16:25,810
Count me out

276
00:16:26,060 --> 00:16:28,320
Out of service, out of Africa

277
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:30,980
l wouldn't hang about

278
00:16:31,650 --> 00:16:35,360
